<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19566" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βασκ-ᾰνία</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>malign influence, witchery,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phd.</u>
				95b
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β. φαυλότητος ἀμαυροῖ τὸ καλόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Wi.</u>
					4.12
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βασκανίας φάρμακον τὸ πήγανον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					926b20
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>malignity,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγνωμοσύνη καὶ β.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					18.252
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄχλος καὶ β.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					19.24
				</span></i>
			: pl., <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>4 Ma.</u>
				2.15
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>jealousy,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἤεισεν κρέσσονα βασκανίης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Call.
					<u>Epigr.</u>
					23
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.81
			</span></i>, al.</div>
